# Baseline for scripts/forbid_unclassified_layer_dim.sh — SHRINK-ONLY
# RATCHET. Established 2026-10-02 (Phase 300), seeded from the measured
# census of `Opacity(` / `AnimatedOpacity(` / `SliverOpacity(` /
# `FadeTransition(` sites under lib/ that carry no classification comment.
# Format: `<repo-relative path>:<number of unclassified sites permitted>`.
#
# These are NOT approved. They are the honest measurement of a debt: CI
# goldens discard layer opacity (Phase 299), so any state-signalling dim
# listed here has never been observed by a golden, and may not have been
# observed by anything. Each state-signalling site must eventually earn
#     // dim-gated: <test path with a dim_probe assertion>
# and each transient one (entrance fade, scroll-linked, breathing
# skeleton, value 0/1 at rest)
#     // dim-decorative: <why>
#
# THE LIST ONLY SHRINKS. Adding a line, or raising a count, is never the
# fix for a new site — classify it. When you classify a listed site,
# decrement its count in the same change (delete the line at zero). The
# count must match the tree EXACTLY: a count above the real number is a
# STALE entry and the guard fails until it is shrunk.
#
# Regenerate (baseline reset only, never to make CI green):
